E AX3073 1040-forging-cast.ax:38:13-15 undeclared-unsafe "`toHid` forges `Hid` out of `Int` with `as`, and its declaration does not say so" #"forges a reference" ^38:16-17:"source has type `Int`; the conversion trusts its representation" ?36:1:"write `;@axiom:effect(unsafe)` above the declaration"~>";@axiom:effect(unsafe)\n" ?"prefer a constructor or a typed library operation. For a raw conversion, prove the target's layout and validity, and keep its backing owner alive. Changing the type does not extend a region's scope" ?"the unsafe tag marks a trusted boundary: you must make every well-typed call safe. It leaves ordinary type, effect and restriction checks in place"
